  "meaning": "The wind of TRAPPIST-1 in the plane of its planets' orbits, as the magnetohydrodynamic model of Garraffo et al. (2017) gives it for a mean surface field of 600 G: the wind's total pressure, magnetic plus dynamic, on a color scale from dark blue (lowest) to yellow (highest), and as a dashed white line the Alfven surface, the boundary inside which the star's magnetic field still holds the wind. Read from the paper's Figure 3 (left); a model, not an observation."
